rd, el culto e irascible inspector Morse (John Thaw) y su leal compañero, el sargento Lewis (Kevin Whately), investigan los complejos delitos. Ganadora de numerosos premios BAFTA al mejor drama y al mejor actor, esta icónica serie de detectives es una de las más prestigiosas y populares de todos los tiempos.","popularity":31.7172,"poster_path":"/cvGqqBcCwahSQgLsCLdUKZG1Skq.jpg","first_air_date":"1987-01-06","softcore":false,"name":"Inspector Morse","vote_average":7.877,"vote_count":146},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/1YoAthqshsSy4gYHEhxJlZgizKH.jpg","genre_ids":[35,18],"id":3485,"origin_country":["GB"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"Agony","overview":"","popularity":4.3265,"poster_path":"/ljtR7MUzvvAcDIRq0rB0aI8aB96.jpg","first_air_date":"1979-03-11","softcore":false,"name":"Agony","vote_average":6.556,"vote_count":9},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/g0jrLzirUBJctRCxFTGlUfzGDEo.jpg","genre_ids":[9648,18],"id":95946,"origin_country":["CN"],"original_language":"zh","original_name":"晨阳","overview":"","popularity":2.476,"poster_path":"/h5eOLC1QZNL8jRMjm73thnUCA7d.jpg","first_air_date":"2019-04-09","softcore":false,"name":"晨阳","vote_average":8.0,"vote_count":1},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/RxfwuFrlZ2lCjYfYDWyS6ouK5J.jpg","genre_ids":[10766,18],"id":128794,"origin_country":["MX"],"original_language":"es","original_name":"La desalmada","overview":"Fernanda jura venganza después de que su esposo es asesinado y ella es violada en su noche de bodas. Con un mal recuerdo de esa noche traumática, Fernanda confunde a su verdadero amor, Rafael, con el hombre que arruinó su vida: el padre de Rafael.","popularity":8.4536,"poster_path":"/f7s3EsUtq0ZBH2pEhqxLa446IkQ.jpg","first_air_date":"2021-07-05","softcore":false,"name":"La desalmada","vote_average":7.634,"vote_count":71},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/cCA9ARWsd0yGv1NPss78A6Xkzvc.jpg","genre_ids":[10759,80],"id":63030,"origin_country":["TR"],"original_language":"tr","original_name":"Filinta: Bir Osmanlı Polisiye