 su pasado. Lo acompaña en este viaje su nuevo adjunto, Jim Chee. Chee también tiene viejas cuentas que saldar de su juventud en la reserva. Los dos hombres luchan juntos contra las fuerzas del mal, entre sí y contra sus propios demonios personales en su camino hacia la salvación.","popularity":33.247,"poster_path":"/kDlrMN0P9ByrEH2GoRbBFeZHbcf.jpg","first_air_date":"2022-06-12","softcore":false,"name":"Dark Winds","vote_average":7.486,"vote_count":216},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/6iuzPJVau9yOibsMK8oE3IF1wpm.jpg","genre_ids":[9648,18],"id":3627,"origin_country":["GB"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"The Lakes","overview":"","popularity":8.1285,"poster_path":"/dPCYCwke0VK1ILpVTYZsqRu1722.jpg","first_air_date":"1997-09-14","softcore":false,"name":"The Lakes","vote_average":7.0,"vote_count":12},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/dsf201EcCENveE99OHK6vwYgekn.jpg","genre_ids":[10763,80,99],"id":3719,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"48 Hours","overview":"","popularity":26.9564,"poster_path":"/kniPe4BLIcj2WnErZcFeHo50q6B.jpg","first_air_date":"1988-01-19","softcore":false,"name":"48 Hours","vote_average":7.0,"vote_count":56},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/6FrVFsxsXujg7GJiBy1sw0Fdnji.jpg","genre_ids":[18],"id":3750,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"Nip/Tuck","overview":"Sean y Christian son dos prestigiosos cirujanos plásticos que trabajan en la lujosa y glamourosa Miami. El trabajo, las envidias, los problemas personales y amorosos se entrecruzan en afiladas tramas. En 2004 esta popular y cínica teleserie, entonces minoritaria, sorprendió a todos cuando consiguió el Globo de Oro a la mejor serie dramática de televisión, venciendo a \"The Sopranos\", la gran favorita.","popularity":75.603,"poster_path":"/nMZ0tan85hxc6n8tVh9XuZHnpgs.jpg","first_air_date":"2003-07-22","softcore":false,"name":"Nip/Tuck, a golpe de bisturí","vote_average":7.182,"vote_count":539},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/8d1eC0K2HpRj9TRP0Jm9WoQh9Xj.jpg","genre_ids":[35,18],"id":3783,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"Room 222","overview":"","popularity":21.636,"poster_path":"/gcAILcFjcpa6YQkMuwYhXBk2pog.jpg","first_air_date":"1969-09-11","softcore":false,"name":"Room 222","vote_average":6.132,"vote_count":19},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[18],"id":3785,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_name":"Side Order of Life","overview":"","popularity":6.2043,"poster_path":"/dtnkWgDSWHpGMFYS8hPGkgRRyvU.jpg","first_air_date":"2007-07-15","softcore":false,"name":"Side Order of Life","vote_average":8.5,"vote_count":2},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/n7F79xjSkhJJp7IIXGEtmqBFdcS.jpg","genre_ids":[18,9648,80],"id":211927,"origin_country":["CN"],"original_language":"zh","original_name":"尘封十三载","overview":"","popularity":4.7989,"poster_path":"/uPGPeWo7v65HePODxE9vQQd1Z94.jpg","first_air_date":"2023-04-06","softcore":false,"name":"尘封十三载","vote_average":7.8,"vote_count":20}],"total_pages":1001,"total_results":20001},"videos":{"results":[{"iso_639_1":"es","iso_3166_1":"ES","name":"Breaking Bad :Trailer en español","key":"V8WQhxHEmMc","site":"YouTube","size":360,"type":"Trailer","official":false,"id":"664bb0efac111d8b687ce6d8","published_at":"2018-08-22T23:24:09.000Z"}]},"recommendations":{"page":1,"results":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/rfxryDIv8huejujg4JueDJx8zCz.jpg","id":60059,"name":"Better Call Saul","original_name":"Better Call Saul","overview":"Esta precuela de \"Breaking Bad\" nominada al Emmy narra la vida del picapleitos Jimmy McGill y su transformación en Saul Goodman, el abogado de moral laxa.","poster_path":"/fC2HDm5t0kHl7mTm7jxMR31b7by.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[80,18],"popularity":107.5184,"first_air_date":"2015-02-08","softcore":false,"vote_average":8.714,"vote_count":6905,"origin_country":["US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/64jEzC7YeKEpnn1YwjCGRo9ZvOX.jpg","id":80968,"name":"Narcos: México","original_name":"Narcos: Mexico","overview":"La nueva saga de \"Narcos\" cuenta la historia real del ascenso al poder del cártel de Guadalajara y el inicio de las guerras de la droga en el México de los años 80.","poster_path":"/yCid4sQkaVzfa2y4yQWs5E0TES9.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[18,80],"popularity":32.6179,"first_air_date":"2018-11-16","softcore":false,"vote_average":7.918,"vote_count":1542,"origin_country":["US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/eEXwPg7nIERmRHC1yJoBf3Q5C7k.jpg","id":71694,"name":"Snowfall","original_name":"Snowfall","overview":"Retrata los comienzos de la epidemia de la cocaína y del crack en Los Ángeles de principios de los 80, y sus radicales impactos en la cultura tal y como la conocemos. La historia sigue a numerosos personajes: Franklin Saint, un joven emprendedor de la calle en búsqueda del poder; Gustavo Zapata, un luchador mejicano reconvertido en gangster; Teddy McDonald, un policía de la CIA que escapa de un oscuro pasado y empieza una operación por su cuenta para fundar los Nicaraguan Contras y Lucia Villanueva, la hija de un narcotraficante mejicano.","poster_path":"/y7ntzl7msiaS6o7dvDbNG7XFYcR.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[18,80],"popularity":56.2817,"first_air_date":"2017-07-05","softcore":false,"vote_average":8.387,"vote_count":813,"origin_country":["US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/y9ekzkPFmWSqUU3Kj0wHmYUM8qu.jpg","id":63351,"name":"Narcos","original_name":"Narcos","overview":"La verdadera historia de los poderosos y violentos cárteles colombianos sirve de hilo conductor en esta serie dramática de mafiosos de gran realismo.","poster_path":"/hbe0lyWfTu7Rm9bC9HsjTNVKOBU.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[80,18],"popularity":46.8995,"first_air_date":"2015-08-28","softcore":false,"vote_average":8.083,"vote_count":3458,"origin_country":["US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/uNvpN37f9HbvsDBQFhHU5m2EnVo.jpg","id":128904,"name":"Dark Winds","original_name":"Dark Winds","overview":"Año 1971 en un punto remoto de la Nación Navajo cerca de Monument Valley. El teniente Joe Leaphorn de la Policía Tribal está abrumado por una serie de crímenes, aparentemente, sin relación entre ellos. Cuanto más se acerca a la verdad, más se abren las heridas de su pasado. Lo acompaña en este viaje su nuevo adjunto, Jim Chee. Chee también tiene viejas cuentas que saldar de su juventud en la reserva. Los dos hombres luchan juntos contra las fuerzas del mal, entre sí y contra sus propios demonios personales en su camino hacia la salvación.","poster_path":"/kDlrMN0P9ByrEH2GoRbBFeZHbcf.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[18,80,9648],"popularity":33.247,"first_air_date":"2022-06-12","softcore":false,"vote_average":7.486,"vote_count":216,"origin_country":["US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/eQJwfyMqSra10ck8HOoiCrbQR32.jpg","id":66025,"name":"Animal Kingdom","original_name":"Animal Kingdom","overview":"La serie se centra en una familia de criminales mientras se enfrentan a la policía. Sus vidas quedan atrapadas en medio de esta lucha y se ven en la obligación de tomar bandos.","poster_path":"/rzvdKrnSRKPFI0pgqMQknDPpRC9.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[80,18],"popularity":63.5215,"first_air_date":"2016-06-14","softcore":false,"vote_average":7.79,"vote_count":572,"origin_country":["US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/3NVXTxrzxm5x7MBaQlzeLZk9pRD.jpg","id":66676,"name":"Queen of the South","original_name":"Queen of the South","overview":"Obligada a trabajar para un cártel que acaba de matar a su novio, Teresa depende de su astucia callejera, de un amigo leal y de un misterioso cuaderno para sobrevivir.","poster_path":"/rzdC5EHkkKJE6OPVdh6gT1pR1c9.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[80,18],"popularity":21.3257,"first_air_date":"2016-06-23","softcore":false,"vote_average":7.62,"vote_count":481,"origin_country":["US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/2INMEKxee4z0mVYpHCS4AdPxgOb.jpg","id":81358,"name":"Mr. Inbetween","original_name":"Mr Inbetween","overview":"Ray Shoesmith es un padre, ex esposo, novio y mejor amigo: papeles difíciles de hacer en la era moderna. Aún más difícil cuando eres un criminal de alquiler.","poster_path":"/1FkONly4j7hxi6Pz5CmuhRN1Ops.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[80,18],"popularity":16.3078,"first_air_date":"2018-09-25","softcore":false,"vote_average":8.295,"vote_count":369,"origin_country":["US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/vlG182ZY2WMzD5bjFZNnhyvv5V4.jpg","id":40008,"name":"Hannibal","original_name":"Hannibal","overview":"Will Graham, que trabaja en el FBI como analista de crímenes, tiene una capacidad innata para empatizar con los psicópatas, lo que le permite entender sus motivaciones. Pero, cuando se da cuenta de que la mente del asesino en serie que está buscando es demasiado compleja incluso para él, recaba la ayuda de uno de principales psiquiatras del país, el Dr. Hannibal Lecter.","poster_path":"/pbV2eLnKSIm1epSZt473UYfqaeZ.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[18,80],"popularity":50.2167,"first_air_date":"2013-04-04","softcore":false,"vote_average":8.263,"vote_count":3067,"origin_country":["US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/4TdmuuwiIiKw3JOjIuhdgYxRXnN.jpg","id":194764,"name":"El Pingüino","original_name":"The Penguin","overview":"Sigue la lucha de Oswald “Oz” Cobb por hacerse con el control de Gotham. Con la ciudad destrozada después del colapso de los diques, Oz busca llenar el vacío de poder que dejó la muerte de Carmine Falcone y darle a su madre Francis la vida que siempre le prometió. Pero antes Oz tendrá que enfrentarse a sus enemigos, incluidos los hijos de Falcone: Sofia y Alberto; la familia Maroni, dirigida por su patriarca encarcelado, Salvatore Maroni; y la propia reputación desmoralizadora de Oz como El Pingüino.","poster_path":"/mW2qLgX1Z336obi5rWKQFaKw98n.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[18,80],"popularity":29.6089,"first_air_date":"2024-09-19","softcore":false,"vote_average":8.353,"vote_count":1495,"origin_country":["US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/mNHRGO1gFpR2CYZdANe72kcKq7G.jpg","id":153312,"name":"Tulsa King","original_name":"Tulsa King","overview":"Justo después de ser liberado de prisión después de 25 años, el capo de la mafia de Nueva York, Dwight \"El General\" Manfredi, es exiliado sin contemplaciones por su jefe para instalarse en Tulsa, Oklahoma. Al darse cuenta de que su familia de la mafia puede no tener sus mejores intereses en mente, Dwight construye lentamente una \"tripulación\" a partir de un grupo de personajes inverosímiles, para ayudarlo a establecer un nuevo imperio criminal en un lugar que para él bien podría ser otro planeta.","poster_path":"/6ryay9RQfT5jrY9i1dveUUGryAO.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[80,18],"popularity":97.2516,"first_air_date":"2022-11-13","softcore":false,"vote_average":8.306,"vote_count":2798,"origin_country":["US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/nj06Yo0yVzI7jx6novjyGOyNQKC.jpg","id":137893,"name":"Griselda","original_name":"Griselda","overview":"Esta serie de ficción basada en hechos reales narra la trayectoria de Griselda Blanco desde Medellín hasta que se erigió en «la Madrina» del emporio de la droga de Miami.","poster_path":"/qT8OLi18IwkX6JwVoybJFagNSea.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[18,80],"popularity":8.71,"first_air_date":"2024-01-25","softcore":false,"vote_average":7.227,"vote_count":416,"origin_country":["US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/n7dkSG7IbMfqoRoDf4HpC28R9nM.jpg","id":70168,"name":"Demasiado viejo para morir joven","original_name":"Too Old to Die Young","overview":"Una trágica noche, la vida de Martin Jones, un ayudante de sheriff del condado de Los Ángeles, salta por los aires y se ve obligado a entrar en un mundo clandestino y letal de soldados del cártel, asesinos yakuza y justicieros misteriosos. No tardará en verse inmerso en una odisea surrealista de asesinato, misticismo y venganza mientras le acechan sus antiguos pecados.","poster_path":"/uFZ6fW5kaRzakbotZS7Z1RHbzPI.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[80,18],"popularity":12.4914,"first_air_date":"2019-06-10","softcore":false,"vote_average":7.4,"vote_count":193,"origin_country":["US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/csOIulXwQxsuCFp3ZZ9cYkJmCwH.jpg","id":71715,"name":"Chicas buenas","original_name":"Good Girls","overview":"Tres madres de los suburbios se encuentran en una situación desesperada y deciden salir de su zona de confort y arriesgarlo todo para recuperar su poder.","poster_path":"/3C4Tzb6m3UBtK4LNdjbQxUYg2Re.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[18,80],"popularity":50.0687,"first_air_date":"2018-02-26","softcore":false,"vote_average":7.817,"vote_count":717,"origin_country":["US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/f1Z5X3iCCKK5FGu5VvzPkXO7eOl.jpg","id":64199,"name":"Sneaky Pete","original_name":"Sneaky Pete","overview":"Marius es joven estafador que ha estado un largo tiempo en la cárcel. Cuando cumple su condena y consigue salir de allí, decide robar la identidad de su compañero de celda Pete, para poder escapar de su pasado. Así es como Marius se convierte en Pete y comienza una vida con su nueva familia, que se dedica al negocio de los préstamos para el pago de finanzas. El joven empieza a relacionarse con criminales peores que él y no tarda en dar con un acreedor que comienza a chantajearle.","poster_path":"/nNpcea9lLHI4iv8QpOIvHveVnT9.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[18,80],"popularity":42.054,"first_air_date":"2015-08-07","softcore":false,"vote_average":7.491,"vote_count":432,"origin_country":["US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/fQ3LSr8KpLBz4xegkGdLd07AlI6.jpg","id":239826,"name":"Ballard","original_name":"Ballard","overview":"La inspectora Renée Ballard se sumerge en una red de asesinatos y corrupción mientras persigue a un cruel asesino en serie y descubre una siniestra conspiración policial que amenaza todo lo que defiende. Con sus propios demonios acechándola, Ballard debe burlar a criminales y colegas para proporcionarle la tan esperada justicia a las víctimas y sus familias.","poster_path":"/3ErR4qIwAWQPlonlfko4j6UlPiP.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[18,80],"popularity":16.4416,"first_air_date":"2025-07-09","softcore":false,"vote_average":7.2,"vote_count":199,"origin_country":["US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/ulm1ex4JFYJByyaPyqTr47MFyEQ.jpg","id":225171,"name":"Pluribus","original_name":"Pluribus","overview":"La persona más desgraciada de la Tierra tiene que salvar al mundo de la felicidad.","poster_path":"/stkYbERuo2YYuay37rYaE41Izyu.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[18,10765],"popularity":45.027,"first_air_date":"2025-11-06","softcore":false,"vote_average":7.93,"vote_count":1115,"origin_country":["US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/ojSWom4hbO8RAhMem8jITICrKlD.jpg","id":85385,"name":"L.A.'s Finest. Policías de Los Ángeles","original_name":"L.A.'s Finest","overview":"Spin-off' femenino de la película Dos policías rebeldes, L.A.'s Finest se centra en la policía Syd Burnett y su nueva vida. Tras eliminar un cartel de droga en Miami y Cuba, la joven decide dejar atrás su pasado para entrar en el Departamento de Policía de Los Ángeles. En esta nueva etapa la acompaña Nancy McKenna, su nueva compañera y madre trabajadora que también tiene un oscuro pasado. Todo va bien entre ellas hasta que Nancy averigua que Syd podría ocultar un gran secreto personal. Esto provoca que las cosas entre las dos policías se vuelvan complejas.","poster_path":"/er9CGqzf1ezbTpRqK06eNUeodGM.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[80,18],"popularity":22.4719,"first_air_date":"2019-05-13","softcore":false,"vote_average":6.895,"vote_count":261,"origin_country":["US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/qdZCF4FXQwOgkd8PIIQelbDqAYO.jpg","id":100010,"name":"Big Sky","original_name":"Big Sky","overview":"Dos detectives privados, Cassie Dewell y Cody Hoyt, colaboran con Jenny, ex policía de la que Cody está separado, para buscar a dos hermanas a las que secuestra un camionero en una carretera perdida de Montana. Cuando descubren que no son las únicas chicas que han desaparecido en la zona, tienen que darse prisa para detener al asesino antes de que se lleve a más mujeres.","poster_path":"/4CUK42x0TvcWvuRXfjAFQlCeRdf.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[80,18,9648],"popularity":35.6461,"first_air_date":"2020-11-17","softcore":false,"vote_average":7.209,"vote_count":302,"origin_country":["US"]},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/is3ZdGCPEKTW7IyDe0khvE1nc6R.jpg","id":225634,"name":"Monstruos: La historia de Lyle y Erik Menendez","original_name":"Monsters: The Lyle and Erik Menendez Story","overview":"Este estremecedor drama de crímenes reales investiga la vida de los hermanos Menendez, condenados por el brutal asesinato de sus padres en Beverly Hills en 1989.","poster_path":"/ziGwbvZvcyy8i3cYNUCDLkQGsU0.jpg","media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[18,80],"popularity":38.2432,"first_air_date":"2024-09-19","softcore":false,"vote_average":7.595,"vote_count":563,"origin_country":["US"]}],"total_pages":27,"total_results":533},"translations":{"translations":[{"iso_3166_1":"US","iso_639_1":"en","name":"English","english_name":"English","data":{"name":"","overview":"Walter White, a New Mexico chemistry teacher, is diagnosed with Stage III cancer and given a prognosis of only two years left to live. He becomes filled with a sense of fearlessness and an unrelenting desire to secure his family's financial future at any cost as he enters the dangerous world of drugs and crime.","homepage":"","tagline":"Change the equation."}},{"iso_3166_1":"DE","iso_639_1":"de","name":"Deutsch","english_name":"German","data":{"name":"","overview":"Ein krebskranker Chemielehrer tut sich mit einem ehemaligen Schüler zusammen, um die Zukunft seiner Familie durch die Herstellung und den Verkauf von Meth zu sichern.","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"FR","iso_639_1":"fr","name":"Français","english_name":"French","data":{"name":"","overview":"Un professeur de chimie atteint d'un cancer s'associe à un ancien élève pour fabriquer et vendre de la méthamphétamine afin d'assurer l'avenir financier de sa famille.","homepage":"","tagline":"Souviens-toi de mon nom."}},{"iso_3166_1":"NL","iso_639_1":"nl","name":"Nederlands","english_name":"Dutch","data":{"name":"","overview":"Walter White is scheikundeleraar. Op het moment dat zijn vrouw zwanger is van hun tweede kind, stort Walters wereld in. De dokter heeft namelijk vastgesteld dat hij terminaal ziek is. Walter heeft longkanker en lijkt niet lang meer te zullen leven. Om ervoor te zorgen dat zijn gezin na zijn dood niet in een financiële crisis belandt, besluit Walter over te schakelen naar een leven als crimineel. Met de hulp van Jesse Pinkman, een uitgevallen leerling die in zijn klas heeft gezeten, maakt en verkoopt hij de drug crystal meth.","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"TR","iso_639_1":"tr","name":"Türkçe","english_name":"Turkish","data":{"name":"","overview":"Kanserden öleceğini öğrenen bir kimya öğretmeni, ailesinin geleceğini garanti altına almak için metamfetamin üretip satmak üzere eski bir öğrencisiyle kafa kafaya verir.","homepage":"","tagline":"Tehlike benim!"}},{"iso_3166_1":"SK","iso_639_1":"sk","name":"Slovenčina","english_name":"Slovak","data":{"name":"Perníkový tatko","overview":"Stredoškolskému učiteľovi chémie je diagnostikovaná rakovina a tak sa rozhodne pred svojou smrťou zaopatriť výrobou metam­fetamínu svoju rodinu. Seriál vyniká úplne famóznou premenou hlavnej postavy z obyčajného človeka na kľúčovú postavu drogového obchodu a skutočného bossa.","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"RU","iso_639_1":"ru","name":"Pусский","english_name":"Russian","data":{"name":"Во все тяжкие","overview":"Школьный учитель химии Уолтер Уайт узнаёт, что болен раком лёгких. Учитывая сложное финансовое состояние дел семьи, а также перспективы, Уолтер решает заняться изготовлением метамфетамина. Для этого он привлекает своего бывшего ученика Джесси Пинкмана, когда-то исключённого из школы при активном содействии Уайта. Пинкман сам занимался варкой мета, но накануне, в ходе рейда УБН, он лишился подельника и лаборатории.","homepage":"","tagline":"«Запомните моё имя»"}},{"iso_3166_1":"HU","iso_639_1":"hu","name":"Magyar","english_name":"Hungarian","data":{"name":"Totál szívás","overview":"Egy középiskolai kémiatanárnál rákot állapítanak meg. Családja jövőjének biztosítása érdekében összefog volt diákjával, hogy metamfetamint állítsanak elő és adjanak el.","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"CN","iso_639_1":"zh","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","data":{"name":"绝命毒师","overview":"新墨西哥州的高中化学老师沃尔特·H·怀特是拮据家庭的唯一经济来源。他大半生安分守己，兢兢业业，却在50岁生日之际突然得知自己罹患肺癌晚期的噩耗，原本便不甚顺意的人生顿时雪上加霜。为了保障怀孕的妻子斯凯勒和残疾的儿子小沃特能在自己死后衣食无忧，沃尔特决意铤而走险。他主动找到曾经的学生、而今的毒贩小混混杰西·平克曼谈合作，并运用娴熟高超的化学技术提炼出高纯度冰毒交给后者贩售。孰料事态的发展却在平克曼带回毒品供销商疯狂小八及其表弟后急转直下，沃尔特的人生也由此彻底步向失控。他被迫开始了教书与制毒的双重生活，逐渐坠落至万劫不复的深渊。","homepage":"","tagline":"改变这个方程。"}},{"iso_3166_1":"ES","iso_639_1":"es","name":"Español","english_name":"Spanish","data":{"name":"","overview":"Un profesor de química con cáncer terminal se asocia con un exalumno suyo para fabricar y vender metanfetamina a fin de que su familia no pase apuros económicos.","homepage":"","tagline":"Recuerda mi nombre"}},{"iso_3166_1":"GR","iso_639_1":"el","name":"ελληνικά","english_name":"Greek","data":{"name":"","overview":"Ένας καθηγητής που πάσχει από καρκίνο συνεργάζεται με έναν πρώην μαθητή για να εξασφαλίσει το μέλλον της οικογένειάς του, παρασκευάζοντας και πουλώντας μεθαμφεταμίνη.","homepage":"","tagline":"Να θυμάσαι το όνομά μου"}},{"iso_3166_1":"PT","iso_639_1":"pt","name":"Português","english_name":"Portuguese","data":{"name":"","overview":"Um professor do secundário com cancro do pulmão terminal junta-se a um ex-aluno para fabricar e vender metanfetaminas como forma de garantir o futuro da sua família.","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"IT","iso_639_1":"it","name":"Italiano","english_name":"Italian","data":{"name":"","overview":"Un insegnante di chimica con un cancro allo stadio terminale comincia a produrre e spacciare metanfetamina con un suo ex studente per assicurare un futuro alla famiglia.","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"BG","iso_639_1":"bg","name":"български език","english_name":"Bulgarian","data":{"name":"В обувките на Сатаната","overview":"Обикновения и нехаризматичен учител по химия – Уолтър открива нова страст в живота си, след като разбира, че е болен от рак в последен стадий. Освен че е пожънал множество успехи в химията, Уолтър обучава апатични гимназисти и работи на непълен работен ден в една автомивка, за да издържа семейството си. Доходите на жена му са съвсем скромни, а синът им Уолтър младши - твърдоглав 17-годишен тийнейджър, страда от церебрална парализа. За да осигури прехраната на любимите си хора Уолтър си поставя нови цели и се отдава на вълнуващ престъпен живот.","homepage":"","tagline":"Запомнете името ми"}},{"iso_3166_1":"RO","iso_639_1":"ro","name":"Română","english_name":"Romanian","data":{"name":"","overview":"Dramă premiată cu două statuete Emmy de mare audiență, serialul spune povestea lui Walter, un profesor de chimie care, lovit în plin de criza de la mijlocul vieții - cea mai gravă criză din câte s-au văzut vreodată -, începe să încalce legea prin fapte de o gravitate din ce în ce mai mare.","homepage":"","tagline":"Amintește-ți numele meu."}},{"iso_3166_1":"KR","iso_639_1":"ko","name":"한국어/조선말","english_name":"Korean","data":{"name":"브레이킹 배드","overview":"2008년 1월 AMC에서 방영을 시작한 범죄 스릴러. Breaking Bad는 막가기를 뜻하는 미국 남부 지방의 속어이다. 한때 노벨화학상까지 바라 볼 정도로 뛰어난 과학자였던 고등학교 화학 교사 월터 화이트는 자신의 50세 생일 날에 폐암 3기 진단을 받는다. 어느 날 동서와 함께 마약 단속 현장을 참관한 그는 현장에서 달아나는 옛 제자 제시를 발견한다. 뇌성마비에 걸린 고등학생 아들과 임신한 아내를 위해 제시에게 동업을 제의한 월터는 자신의 화학지식을 이용해 전례없는 고순도 고품질의 메스암페타민을 제조한다.","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"IL","iso_639_1":"he","name":"עִבְרִית","english_name":"Hebrew","data":{"name":"שובר שורות","overview":"סדרת דרמה המתמקדת בוולטר וויט, מורה לכימיה בתיכון שסובל ממקרה חמור של משבר אמצע החיים, בנוסף הוא מתבשר שהינו גוסס ממחלה קשה. על מנת לממן את הטיפולים היקרים ולדאוג לעתיד משפחתו הוא חובר לתלמיד לשעבר והופך ליצרן וסוחר במתאמפטמין.","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"PL","iso_639_1":"pl","name":"Polski","english_name":"Polish","data":{"name":"","overview":"Głównym bohaterem jest Walter White, nauczyciel chemii mieszkający w Nowym Meksyku wraz z żoną oraz nastoletnim synem cierpiącym na porażenie mózgowe. Kiedy u Waltera zostaje zdiagnozowany rak w trzecim stadium, lekarze rokują, że pozostały mu dwa lata życia. Dzięki tym prognozom Walter wyzbywa się wszelkich lęków i pragnąc zabezpieczyć swoją rodzinę finansowo decyduje się wkroczyć do niebezpiecznego świata narkotyków i zbrodni.","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"DK","iso_639_1":"da","name":"Dansk","english_name":"Danish","data":{"name":"","overview":"Efter at være blevet diagnosticeret med kræft og givet blot to år tilbage at leve i forsøger kemilæreren Walter at sikre sin families fremtidige økonomiske situation ved at slå sig sammen med en tidligere studerende, Jesse, for at producere og sælge det ulovlige stof amfetamin. Mens Walter langsomt bygger sit imperium op, begynder hans kone Skyler at undre sig over hans uregelmæssige adfærd, og politiet sætter jagten ind på kvarterets nye bagmand.","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"CZ","iso_639_1":"cs","name":"Český","english_name":"Czech","data":{"name":"Perníkový táta","overview":"Co se stane, když u středoškolského oceňovaného učitele chemie diagnostikují rakovinu plic v pokročilém stádiu? Dá se na kriminální dráhu jako drogový dealer, aby stihl vydělat co nejvíce peněz pro svou těhotnou ženu...","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"JP","iso_639_1":"ja","name":"日本語","english_name":"Japanese","data":{"name":"ブレイキング・バッド","overview":"家族に金を残したい―。ガンで余命宣告された冴えない高校の化学教師が、元教え子と組みドラッグ精製と売買に手を染める。","homepage":"","tagline":"私の名は…"}},{"iso_3166_1":"UA","iso_639_1":"uk","name":"Український","english_name":"Ukrainian","data":{"name":"Пуститися берега","overview":"Шкільний учитель хімії Волтер Вайт дізнається, що хворий на рак легенів. З огляду на складний фінансовий стан справ сім'ї, а також перспективи, Волтер вирішує зайнятися виготовленням метамфетаміну. Для цього він залучає свого колишнього учня Джессі Пінкмана, колись виключеного зі школи за активного сприяння Вайта. Пінкман сам займався «варінням мету», але напередодні, в ході рейду УБН, він позбувся напарника і лабораторії.","homepage":"","tagline":"Як далеко ти готовий зайти заради родини?"}},{"iso_3166_1":"SE","iso_639_1":"sv","name":"svenska","english_name":"Swedish","data":{"name":"","overview":"I Vince Giligans geniala serie får vi följa en cancersjuk kemilärare som slår sig ihop med en tidigare student för att tillverka och sälja metamfetamin för att trygga sin familjs framtid efter sin kommande bortgång. Hyllad av kritiker som den bästa serien genom tiderna.","homepage":"","tagline":"Ändra ekvationen."}},{"iso_3166_1":"BS","iso_639_1":"bs","name":"Bosanski","english_name":"Bosnian","data":{"name":"","overview":"Walter White je srednjovječni profesor kemije koji jednog dana doznaje da boluje od neizlječivog raka pluća, a prognoze nisu sjajne. Uz sve to, ima hendikepirano dijete i trudnu ženu. Prije nego umre, odlučuje da će se pobrinuti za svoju obitelj pa u podrumu stvori laboratorij za proizvodnju droge. Seriju je stvorio Vince Gilligan koji je radio i na „Dosjeima X“, omiljenoj seriji svih zaljubljenika u mistično i natprirodno. Mnogi kritičari pohvalili su odličnu glumu, a serija je općenito dobro prihvaćena i spada među favorite svih fanova pomaknutog humora.","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"HR","iso_639_1":"hr","name":"Hrvatski","english_name":"Croatian","data":{"name":"Na putu prema dolje","overview":"'Na putu prema dolje' prati neobičan i opasan životni put nimalo karizmatičnog i isprva vrlo prosječnog profesora kemije, Waltera Whitea, čiji život se potpuno preokrene kada sazna da je obolio od karcinoma.","homepage":"","tagline":"Upamti moje ime."}},{"iso_3166_1":"LT","iso_639_1":"lt","name":"Lietuvių","english_name":"Lithuanian","data":{"name":"Bręstantis blogis","overview":"Chemijos mokytojas su žmona ir neįgaliu paaugliu sūnumi gyvena Naujojoje Meksikoje. Netikėtai jam nustatomas trečios stadijos vėžys, medikai teigia, kad gyventi beliko metai. Ši žinia ramų vyriškį išlaisvina iš bet kokių baimių ir visuomenės normų. Norėdamas užtikrinti šeimai gerą materialinę ateitį, jis pradeda gaminti aukščiausios kokybės amfetaminą. Mirtina diagnozė tykų namisėdą paverčia narkotikų pasaulio karaliuku.","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"EE","iso_639_1":"et","name":"Eesti","english_name":"Estonian","data":{"name":"Halvale teele","overview":"\"Halvale teele\" on huumorivarjundiga draamasari keemiaõpetaja Walter White'ist (rolli eest Emmy auhinna võitnud Bryan Cranston), keda on tabanud pingeline keskeakriis. Lisaks erivajadustega teismelisele pojale ja naisele, kes temasse külmalt suhtub, diagnoositakse tal ravimatu kopsuvähk. Jõudnud otsusele, et tema elu väärtus on äärmiselt kaheldav, otsustab ta oma endise õpilase, narkomaanist eluheidiku Jesse Pinkmaniga (Aaron Paul) hakata keetma metamfetamiini, ja kus oleks seda parem teha, kui keset kõrbe ja vagunelamus?","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"SA","iso_639_1":"ar","name":"العربية","english_name":"Arabic","data":{"name":"","overview":"والتر وايت مدرس كيمياء موهوب يعيش حياة هادئة ومتواضعة مع عائلته، إلى أن يكتشف إصابته بالسرطان ويقرر تأمين مستقبل أسرته قبل فوات الأوان. يستعين بطالبه السابق جيسي بينكمان لدخول عالم تصنيع وبيع الميثامفيتامين، مستغلًا خبرته في الكيمياء لإنتاج مخدر عالي الجودة. ومع نجاحهما، ينغمس والتر تدريجيًا في عالم الجريمة وتجارة المخدرات، ويبدأ في بناء نفوذ متزايد يضعه في مواجهة تجار مخدرات خطرين وأجهزة إنفاذ القانون، بينما تتغير شخصيته وطموحاته مع ازدياد قوته واتساع إمبراطوريته الإجرامية.","homepage":"","tagline":"هايزنبرغ"}},{"iso_3166_1":"IR","iso_639_1":"fa","name":"فارسی","english_name":"Persian","data":{"name":"بریکینگ بد","overview":"داستان سریال درباره یک معلم شیمی میانسال است که متوجه می‌شود که دارای سرطان ریه است و ۲ سال بیشتر وقت برای زندگی ندارد. او که وضع مالی خوبی ندارد و دارای همسر و پسری معلول می‌باشد، به این فکر می‌افتد که باید قبل از مردن زندگی خانواده خود را تامین کند. پس با توجه به آشناییش به علم شیمی، همراه با یکی از شاگردان سابقش شروع به ساخت و فروش مواد مخدر می‌کند…","homepage":"","tagline":"نام من را به خاطر بسپار"}},{"iso_3166_1":"FI","iso_639_1":"fi","name":"suomi","english_name":"Finnish","data":{"name":"","overview":"Parhaan miespuolisen draamanäyttelijän Emmyn voittanut Bryan Cranston esittää Walter Whitea, taitavaa kemistiä, joka on päätynyt kohtalon oikuista opettajaksi ja osa-aikaiseksi autopesulatyöntekijäksi. Kaikki muuttuu, kun Walter kuulee sairastavansa parantumatonta syöpää. Hän miettii keinoja turvata perheensä toimeentulo jatkossakin ja keksii yllättävän ratkaisun: huumekaupan. Walter ottaa kemistintaitonsa käyttöön ja lähtee rikoksen poluille johtoajatuksenaan, ettei hänellä ole mitään hävittävää. Vaarallisiin huumekuvioihin sekaantuminen ei kuitenkaan tee kiltistä Walterista hirviötä, päinvastoin.","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"TH","iso_639_1":"th","name":"ภาษาไทย","english_name":"Thai","data":{"name":"ดับเครื่องชน คนดีแตก","overview":"ครูสอนเคมีในโรงเรียนมัธยมซึ่งกำลังใกล้ตายด้วยโรคมะเร็งต้องมาร่วมมือกับอดีตนักเรียน เพื่อสร้างความมั่นคงให้กับครอบครัวก่อนที่เขาจะตายด้วยการผลิตยาไอซ์ขาย","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"BR","iso_639_1":"pt","name":"Português","english_name":"Portuguese","data":{"name":"","overview":"Ao saber que tem câncer, um professor passa a fabricar metanfetamina pelo futuro da família, mudando o destino de todos.","homepage":"","tagline":"Se lembre do meu nome."}},{"iso_3166_1":"CA","iso_639_1":"fr","name":"Français","english_name":"French","data":{"name":"Breaking Bad : Le chimiste","overview":"En phase terminale d'un cancer, un professeur de chimie s'allie à un ancien élève pour assurer l'avenir de sa famille en fabriquant et en vendant de la méthamphétamine.","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"MX","iso_639_1":"es","name":"Español","english_name":"Spanish","data":{"name":"","overview":"Un profesor de Química de secundaria con cáncer terminal se asocia a un exestudiante para asegurar el futuro de su familia al fabricar y vender metanfetamina.","homepage":"","tagline":"Vive libre o muere."}},{"iso_3166_1":"RS","iso_639_1":"sr","name":"Srpski","english_name":"Serbian","data":{"name":"Чиста хемија","overview":"Волтер Вајт је професор хемије у средњој школи, који се окреће другој страни закона да би прехранио трудну жену и сина са парализом, након што му је постављена дијагноза рака плућа у поодмаклој фази.","homepage":"","tagline":"Упамти моје име."}},{"iso_3166_1":"TW","iso_639_1":"zh","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","data":{"name":"絕命毒師","overview":"一名即將死於癌症的高中化學老師與他過去的學生一起合作，透過製造及販賣冰毒保障他家人的未來。","homepage":"","tagline":"改變方程式。"}},{"iso_3166_1":"VN","iso_639_1":"vi","name":"Tiếng Việt","english_name":"Vietnamese","data":{"name":"Tập làm người xấu","overview":"Một giáo viên dạy hóa ở trường trung học mắc bệnh ung thư bắt tay với một cựu học sinh để bảo vệ tương lai của gia đình bằng cách sản xuất và bán ma túy đá.","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"NO","iso_639_1":"no","name":"Norsk","english_name":"Norwegian","data":{"name":"Breaking Bad","overview":"En kreftsyk kjemilærer slår seg sammen med en tidligere elev for å produsere og selge metamfetamin slik at han kan sikre familiens framtid.","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"ES","iso_639_1":"ca","name":"Català","english_name":"Catalan","data":{"name":"Breaking Bad","overview":"Walter White és un aplicat professor d'institut, pare de Walter White Jr, un jove discapacitat i marit de Skyler White qui està embarassada. Quan la vida ja era prou complicada per a Walter, li diagnostiquen un càncer de pulmó terminal, i això el porta a infringir la llei tot instal·lant un laboratori de metamfetamina amb el seu antic estudiant Jesse Pinkman per així assegurar el benestar econòmic de la seva família quan ell ja no hi sigui.","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"ID","iso_639_1":"id","name":"Bahasa indonesia","english_name":"Indonesian","data":{"name":"","overview":"Ketika Walter White, seorang guru kimia New Mexico, didiagnosis dengan kanker stadium III dan diberi prognosis hanya dua tahun lagi untuk hidup. Dia dipenuhi dengan rasa tidak takut dan keinginan yang tak henti-hentinya untuk mengamankan masa depan keuangan keluarganya dengan biaya berapa pun ketika dia memasuki dunia narkoba dan kejahatan yang berbahaya.","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"LV","iso_639_1":"lv","name":"Latviešu","english_name":"Latvian","data":{"name":"Pārkāpt robežu","overview":"Valteram Vaitam, Ņūmeksikas štata ķīmijas skolotājam, tiek diagnosticēts III stadijas vēzis, un viņam tiek prognozēti tikai divi gadi līdz mūža beigām. Viņu pārņem bezbailības sajūta un nerimstoša vēlme par katru cenu nodrošināt ģimenes finansiālo nākotni, kas ved viņu iesaistīties bīstamajā narkotiku un noziedzības pasaulē.","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"GE","iso_639_1":"ka","name":"ქართული","english_name":"Georgian","data":{"name":"მძიმე დანაშაული","overview":"უოლტერ უაიტი ქიმიის მასწავლებელია სკოლაში, რომელსაც ფილტვის სიმსივნე აღმოაჩნდა. იმ მიზნით რომ სიკვდილის შემდეგ ოჯახს კარგი ფინანსურ მდგომარეობა დაუტოვოს, იგი ცვლის საკუთარ ცხოვრებას - იწყებს მეტამფეტამინის წარმოებას და გაყიდვას, რაშიც მისი ყოფილი მოწაფე ჯესი პინკმენი ეხმარება.","homepage":"","tagline":"შეცვალე განტოლება."}},{"iso_3166_1":"SI","iso_639_1":"sl","name":"Slovenščina","english_name":"Slovenian","data":{"name":"Kriva pota","overview":"Serija nam prikaže kako lahko usodna diagnoza vpliva na povsem običajnega, pridnega človeka in na njegovo moralo ter ga spremeni v glavnega akterja trgovine z mamili. Učitelj kemije Walter White živi s sinom najstnikom, ki ima cerebralno paralizo in ženo povsem običajno življenje v Novi Mehiki. Ko mu postavijo diagnozo 3. stopnje raka in napovejo le še dve leti življenja spozna, da nima več kaj za izgubiti. Odloči se, da bo pred smrtjo svoji družini zagotovil varno prihodnost, zato se Walt poda na pot drog in kriminala. Začne proizvajati in prodajati metamfetamin z enim od svojih nekdanjih študentov in kmalu se izkaže, da je v tem zanj novem svetu izjemno vešč...","homepage":"","tagline":"Spremenite enačbo."}},{"iso_3166_1":"HK","iso_639_1":"zh","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","data":{"name":"絕命毒師","overview":"一位化學老師為了養家餬口，冒險深入毒品的世界。這部影集氣氛緊張，由布萊恩·克雷斯頓、亞倫·保羅、安娜·古恩主演。","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"MY","iso_639_1":"my","name":"","english_name":"Burmese","data":{"name":"","overview":"","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"UZ","iso_639_1":"uz","name":"ozbek","english_name":"Uzbek","data":{"name":"","overview":"","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"AE","iso_639_1":"ar","name":"العربية","english_name":"Arabic","data":{"name":"","overview":"مدرس كيمياء في مدرسة ثانوية على وشك الوفاة بسبب السرطان، يشترك مع طالب سابق في صناعة وبيع عقار \"الميث\" لتأمين مستقبل أسرته.","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"SG","iso_639_1":"zh","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","data":{"name":"绝命毒师","overview":"一位患有晚期肺癌的高中化学老师为了保证家人未来的生计，决定和以前的学生联手制作并贩卖冰毒。","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"IN","iso_639_1":"hi","name":"हिन्दी","english_name":"Hindi","data":{"name":"","overview":"मौत की कगार पर खड़े हाईस्कूल के कैंसरग्रस्त केमिस्ट्री शिक्षक को अपने परिवार का भविष्य सुरक्षित करना है. वह नशीली दवा बनाने और बेचने के लिए एक पूर्व छात्र को साथ लेता है.","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"MY","iso_639_1":"ms","name":"Bahasa melayu","english_name":"Malay","data":{"name":"","overview":"","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"PH","iso_639_1":"tl","name":"","english_name":"Tagalog","data":{"name":"","overview":"","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"AZ","iso_639_1":"az","name":"Azərbaycan","english_name":"Azerbaijani","data":{"name":"سیندیران پیسلیک","overview":"","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"BY","iso_639_1":"be","name":"беларуская мова","english_name":"Belarusian","data":{"name":"На ўсе застаўкі","overview":"","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"BD","iso_639_1":"bn","name":"বাংলা","english_name":"Bengali","data":{"name":"ব্রেকিং ব্যাড","overview":"","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"TR","iso_639_1":"ku","name":"","english_name":"Kurdish","data":{"name":"گۆڕانی خراپ","overview":"","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"AM","iso_639_1":"hy","name":"","english_name":"Armenian","data":{"name":"Ամբողջ ծանրությամբ","overview":"","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"KZ","iso_639_1":"kk","name":"қазақ","english_name":"Kazakh","data":{"name":"Бұзықтыққа салыну","overview":"","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"IN","iso_639_1":"kn","name":"?????","english_name":"Kannada","data":{"name":"ಬ್ರೇಕಿಂಗ್ ಬ್ಯಾಡ್","overview":"","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"KG","iso_639_1":"ky","name":"??????","english_name":"Kirghiz","data":{"name":"Бардык жамандыкка барып","overview":"","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"MK","iso_639_1":"mk","name":"","english_name":"Macedonian","data":{"name":"Да станеш лош","overview":"","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"IN","iso_639_1":"ml","name":"","english_name":"Malayalam","data":{"name":"ബ്രേക്കിങ് ബാഡ്","overview":"","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"NP","iso_639_1":"ne","name":"","english_name":"Nepali","data":{"name":"ब्रेकिंग ब्याड","overview":"","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"IN","iso_639_1":"pa","name":"ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","english_name":"Punjabi","data":{"name":"ਬਰੇਕਿੰਗ ਬੈਡ","overview":"","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"LK","iso_639_1":"si","name":"සිංහල","english_name":"Sinhalese","data":{"name":"බ්‍රේකිං බෑඩ්","overview":"","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"IN","iso_639_1":"ta","name":"தமிழ்","english_name":"Tamil","data":{"name":"பிரேக்கிங் பேட்","overview":"","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"TT","iso_639_1":"tt","name":"","english_name":"Tatar","data":{"name":"Кыек юлдан","overview":"","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"UG","iso_639_1":"ug","name":"","english_name":"Uighur","data":{"name":"ئەشەددى ئەبلەق","overview":"","homepage":"","tagline":""}},{"iso_3166_1":"PK","iso_639_1":"ur","name":"اردو","english_name":"Urdu","data":{"name":"بریکنگ بیڈ","overview":"","homepage":"","tagline":""}}]},"images":{"backdrops":[],"logos":[],"posters":[]}}